  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to the Diversified Resilient Agriculture for Improved Food and Nutrition Security project (RAINS-TA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the capacity of implementing agencies to successfully implement the Diversified Resilient Agriculture for Improved Food and Nutrition Security Project (RAINS) project and reach the expected results of the project through (a) training-of-trainers activities and follow-up coaching; (b) assisting the development of a benefit ME system, and (c) support for background studies</narrative>
